@startuml HeroSingletonPattern

!theme plain
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontStyle bold

title 英雄机单例模式

class HeroAircraft {
    - {static} volatile HeroAircraft Instance
    
    - HeroAircraft()
    + {static} HeroAircraft getInstance()
}

note right of HeroAircraft : 单例模式核心要素:\n- 私有构造函数\n- 静态实例变量\n- 静态获取方法\n- 全局唯一实例

@enduml
